      // If no tasks can run but some are pending, we have a cycle (should have been caught)
      // or a deadlock due to missing deps (caught by unknown dep check).
      // But let's be safe: if queue is empty and running is empty and pending is not, cycle.
      if (taskQueue.length === 0 && running.size === 0 && pending.size > 0) {
